[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m ### Step 1: Simplify the innermost fraction
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m We start from the innermost part:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
