[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m Now continue outward:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 3 + \frac{1}{\frac{10}{3}} = 3 + \frac{3}{10} = \frac{30}{10} + \frac{3}{10} = \frac{33}{10}
