[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m Now plug that back in the next level:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 3 + \frac{1}{\frac{33}{10}} = 3 + \frac{10}{33} = \frac{99}{33} + \frac{10}{33} = \frac{109}{33}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m Now we are done simplifying the full expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 3 + \frac{1}{3 + \frac{1}{3 + \frac{1}{3}}} = \frac{109}{33}
