[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m ### **Step 1: Compute $9!$ and its prime factorization**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m We start by computing:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=122367)[0m $$
